        "sensor_height_cm": 250,
        "note": "The ground drone of 16b cut AE.3 (16c N15; doc 16 section 2 W2): a small tracked sensor platform with no gun. What it sees its side sees, through the mesh like any teammate's plot, and a laser kills it: 60 on the bow is under one 105 round, and its silhouette is a fifth of a tank's. One section, the body, which destroy_unit ends: no mast section, because no closed consequence kills a sight and this cut adds none, so a drone is killed or it is not. Its eye sits on a 250 cm mast. Tracked at 2,000 cm/s so it goes where a tank goes, quicker. It is class drone, and a side fields at most one. Under the machine it patrols, crosses to the far zone like any machine holding no hostile, and in a Hold match drives for the spot while idle but neither holds nor contests it; a side whose guns are all gone is out of the match though its drone still runs. Version 2 (17b cut M3.1): a doctrine core in the body. Version 4 (M5r): public Hold geometry restores the idle drive to the spot; holding and contesting stay disabled."
